[Script Info]
; toon-video-production default caption style.
; New styles: copy this file into assets/captions/, rename the file, keep the
; Style name "Toon", and pass --template to the captions command — no code
; changes needed. Sized for 1080x1920 vertical; PlayRes keeps positioning
; stable if the render resolution changes.
